# RGP/3.0 context filter. Gitignore syntax; evaluated at the pinned Git commit.
# These paths stay in Git: an agent can fetch them directly when needed.
# This file itself is ALWAYS included in the RGP and documents its scope.
#
# Historic measurements, checkpoints and long-form archived planning.
/benchmarks/
/docs/RGP_INLINE_AGENT_GUIDE.txt
/docs/REVIEW_*.md
/docs/STAGE1_*.md
/docs/AGENT_VALUE_TRIAL_*.md
/docs/RGP_BENCHMARK_BASELINE.md
/docs/GATE_B_REVIEW.md
/docs/gate-a/

# Binary/encoded golden transports, which are especially wasteful in a text RGP.
/tests/fixtures/

# Workflow and repository automation: easy to read from GitHub on demand.
/.github/

# Dependency resolution locks and generated/local build artifacts.
/Cargo.lock
/flake.lock
/uv.lock
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/target/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/coverage/
*.min.js
*.min.css
*.map
